            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Sync Your Progress with Fitness Apps",
            "content": "<p>Stay on top of your fitness goals with seamless app integration! Our treadmill connects with <strong>4 popular fitness apps</strong>, allowing you to <strong>track your workouts, monitor progress, and stay motivated</strong>—all in real time.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
