            "title": "Console LCD Display",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>Stay informed at a glance with the <strong>high-contrast LCD display</strong>, tracking your <strong>speed, time, incline, distance, calories, and heart rate</strong> in real time. Simple, clear, and easy to read for a fully optimized workout.<br/></p>",
